Usage: agent-deck open <file|url> [--session <id|title>] [--profile <panel profile>] [--wait <duration>]
  -profile string
    	Browser panel profile in the app (optional)
  -session string
    	session id or title (default: $AGENTDECK_INSTANCE_ID)
  -wait duration
    	how long to wait for the app to acknowledge before reporting Queued (default 3s)
